      "introTitle": "What do you recycle?",
      "hideAnswersOnError": true,
      "paragraphs": [
        [
          "In my family, we do our best to recycle as much of our ",
          {
            "type": "gap",
            "id": "1",
            "example": true,
            "answer": "rubbish"
          },
          " as possible. In the kitchen, we separate plastic, cans, and glass from other household ",
          {
            "type": "gap",
            "id": "2",
            "input": "select",
            "options": [
              "bins",
              "bin bags",
              "landfill site",
              "refuse collectors",
              "rubbish",
              "waste",
              "waste-paper basket"
            ],
            "answer": "waste"
          },
          ". The children each have a ",
          {
            "type": "gap",
            "id": "3",
            "input": "select",
            "options": [
              "bins",
              "bin bags",
              "landfill site",
              "refuse collectors",
              "rubbish",
              "waste",
              "waste-paper basket"
            ],
            "answer": "waste-paper basket"
          },
          " in their bedroom for used paper. When the ",
          {
            "type": "gap",
            "id": "4",
            "input": "select",
            "options": [
              "bins",
              "bin bags",
              "landfill site",
              "refuse collectors",
              "rubbish",
              "waste",
              "waste-paper basket"
            ],
            "answer": "bin bags"
          },
          " are full, we take them outside and put them in different coloured ",
          {
            "type": "gap",
            "id": "5",
            "input": "select",
            "options": [
              "bins",
              "bin bags",
              "landfill site",
              "refuse collectors",
              "rubbish",
              "waste",
              "waste-paper basket"
            ],
            "answer": "bins"
          },
          " on the street. The bin with all the material that can’t be recycled is emptied every evening by the ",
          {
            "type": "gap",
            "id": "6",
            "input": "select",
            "options": [
              "bins",
              "bin bags",
              "landfill site",
              "refuse collectors",
              "rubbish",
              "waste",
              "waste-paper basket"
            ],
            "answer": "refuse collectors"
          },
          ". The contents are taken to a ",
          {
            "type": "gap",
            "id": "7",
            "input": "select",
            "options": [
              "bins",
              "bin bags",
              "landfill site",
              "refuse collectors",
              "rubbish",
              "waste",
              "waste-paper basket"
            ],
            "answer": "landfill site"
          },
          ". The green recycling bins with plastic, cans, paper, and glass, are emptied about once a week."
        ]
      ]
    },
